WEBVTT

01:40.490 --> 01:45.780
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.440 --> 01:50.650
[Episode 4]

02:05.040 --> 02:06.120
Hongye,

02:06.840 --> 02:08.910
what are you doing at our sword furnace

02:08.910 --> 02:10.370
in the middle of the night?

02:11.680 --> 02:12.680
I was drunk

02:12.700 --> 02:14.050
and went out for a walk.

02:14.080 --> 02:15.240
Suddenly, I wondered

02:15.240 --> 02:17.430
what method you used to forge swords with demon cores,

02:17.430 --> 02:18.630
so I ended up here.

02:20.050 --> 02:21.190
But I didn't expect

02:21.800 --> 02:23.800
your little sword attendant to ring

02:23.800 --> 02:27.060
the Soul-ringing Bone Bell to warn me while I was off guard.

02:33.360 --> 02:34.280
Master,

02:35.710 --> 02:37.310
Young Master Wangquan used an invisibility talisman

02:37.310 --> 02:38.750
and slipped out of my sight.

02:38.750 --> 02:39.960
When I followed him to the sword furnace,

02:39.960 --> 02:42.190
he had already broken through the Mystical Bell Formation,

02:42.190 --> 02:44.520
so I immediately triggered the bone bell.

02:49.170 --> 02:50.820
Oh, Hongye.

02:51.240 --> 02:53.050
You could've just told me you wanted to take a look.

02:53.050 --> 02:54.910
Why did you sneak around like that

02:55.800 --> 02:58.079
and make us all scramble?

02:59.240 --> 03:00.520
It was just a whim.

03:00.870 --> 03:01.670
But I must say,

03:02.310 --> 03:04.890
this little sword attendant of your Nangong family is foolishly loyal.

03:04.890 --> 03:06.030
She ruined my mood.

03:07.800 --> 03:09.240
If you don't like her,

03:09.800 --> 03:11.800
I'll have someone else serve you right away.

03:11.800 --> 03:12.360
No.

03:13.430 --> 03:14.910
I prefer those

03:21.280 --> 03:22.680
with a bit of fire in them.

03:25.870 --> 03:26.430
Let's go.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.000
Father.

03:47.610 --> 03:50.270
You've checked it like a hundred times already.

03:51.650 --> 03:53.170
The sword furnace is fine.

03:54.000 --> 03:57.800
The divine sword will definitely be ready on time tomorrow.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.310
Wangquan Hongye

04:00.750 --> 04:03.150
is more calculating than you think.

04:04.630 --> 04:06.290
The more critical the moment,

04:06.960 --> 04:08.560
the more cautious we must be.

04:10.080 --> 04:10.750
Father,

04:11.430 --> 04:13.360
don't worry.

04:15.240 --> 04:18.500
This divine sword is forged with a divine bird's demon core

04:18.630 --> 04:20.230
and refined with demon fire.

04:20.430 --> 04:21.430
Once it's complete,

04:21.430 --> 04:22.630
it will be able

04:22.630 --> 04:23.920
to slay anyone.

04:24.040 --> 04:25.310
Even if Wangquan Hongye

04:25.310 --> 04:27.570
can truly wield the Unparalleled Sword,

04:27.950 --> 04:29.560
we'll have nothing to fear.

04:31.310 --> 04:32.360
Besides,

04:33.240 --> 04:35.750
we still have the Dongfang Divine Fire.

04:36.870 --> 04:38.830
Nothing will go wrong.

04:39.750 --> 04:40.600
Indeed.

04:40.990 --> 04:43.310
If it weren't for Dongfang Huaizhu,

04:43.950 --> 04:47.240
something might have gone wrong with the sword furnace today.

04:47.240 --> 04:50.170
But the Mystical Bell Formation has been destroyed.

04:51.360 --> 04:54.720
I'll have you take people to guard the sword furnace.

04:54.900 --> 04:55.800
Yes.

04:56.920 --> 04:59.950
Send more people to keep watch on Wangquan Hongye.

05:00.720 --> 05:02.390
There must be no more accidents.

05:02.390 --> 05:02.920
Yes.

05:18.390 --> 05:20.390
You didn't say anything all the way.

05:21.560 --> 05:22.360
What's wrong?

05:23.750 --> 05:24.550
Are you angry?

05:36.800 --> 05:38.170
You really are angry.

05:40.870 --> 05:43.330
You're thinking about how confident you are

05:43.710 --> 05:45.510
in leaving me behind to save Nan.

05:47.550 --> 05:49.390
So, you only want to save Nan

05:49.600 --> 05:51.730
and don't care about the other demons.

06:06.430 --> 06:08.970
Can I have a cup of water?

06:17.360 --> 06:18.760
Thank you, Miss Huaizhu,

06:18.830 --> 06:21.450
for choosing me outside the sword furnace.

06:22.740 --> 06:25.360
Are you sure you can save all the demons,

06:26.040 --> 06:27.070
including Nan?

06:27.240 --> 06:29.370
There is no perfect plan in this world.

06:29.640 --> 06:32.270
But if you're willing to help me heal my wounds,

06:32.830 --> 06:34.360
I'll have a better chance.

06:36.190 --> 06:38.450
Why must the sword forging be completed?

06:38.450 --> 06:40.080
Why don't you let me save Nan?

06:40.290 --> 06:42.510
Even if you risk your life to save Nan,

06:42.800 --> 06:44.510
as long as they keep using demon cores to forge swords,

06:44.510 --> 06:46.110
there will be countless Nans

06:46.120 --> 06:48.650
dying in the noble families' sword furnaces.

06:52.570 --> 06:54.630
I have some knowledge of formations.

06:54.650 --> 06:56.750
The Silk-Wound Kasyapa Bell was originally

06:56.750 --> 07:00.010
a hallucinatory bell used by the spider demons of Nanchui.

07:00.190 --> 07:01.560
At today's banquet,

07:01.580 --> 07:04.910
it was used by the Nangong family to set up a sound formation,

07:05.250 --> 07:07.190
[Nangong Sword Furnace]

07:05.560 --> 07:07.700
which was similar to the Mystical Bell Formation

07:07.700 --> 07:09.230
outside the sword furnace.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.780
This Bell Sound Formation

07:15.810 --> 07:17.430
drew power from

07:17.450 --> 07:20.360
the four great demon cores sacrificed by Nangong Ye at the banquet.

07:20.360 --> 07:22.400
The reason it only hurt you

07:22.420 --> 07:24.360
was due to the careful arrangement

07:24.360 --> 07:26.360
of your seat.

07:26.510 --> 07:28.000
When the bell formation was triggered,

07:28.000 --> 07:29.940
the sound waves were reflected

07:30.120 --> 07:32.230
by the screen and converged on you.

07:32.870 --> 07:36.130
Only by tomorrow, when the four demon swords are forged

07:36.560 --> 07:39.159
and Nangong Ye holds the sword unveiling ceremony,

07:39.159 --> 07:41.960
will it be possible to reverse the sound formation

07:42.159 --> 07:43.890
and allow you to fully recover.

07:44.750 --> 07:46.010
Then can you guarantee

07:46.510 --> 07:49.830
that the Bell Sound Formation will be reactivated tomorrow?

07:49.830 --> 07:50.870
Of course not.

07:51.770 --> 07:55.050
However, you can stand at the center of the formation,

07:55.310 --> 07:57.110
where the sound waves converge,

07:57.640 --> 08:00.640
and I will be able to restart the Bell Sound Formation.

08:02.430 --> 08:03.630
After leaving your seat,

08:03.630 --> 08:05.040
take five steps, turn right,

08:05.040 --> 08:06.840
and then take ten steps forward.

08:06.950 --> 08:08.560
Ten steps forward?

08:11.630 --> 08:13.160
That's the situation.

08:14.400 --> 08:16.190
The sword unveiling ceremony tomorrow

08:16.190 --> 08:18.510
is my only chance to treat your injuries.

08:18.810 --> 08:21.070
What condition did Nangong Ye offer you?

08:21.510 --> 08:22.600
Can you tell me?

08:23.120 --> 08:24.750
If I help you win,

08:25.160 --> 08:26.360
please save

08:26.630 --> 08:29.160
a prisoner from the Inspection Bureau for me.

08:29.190 --> 08:29.950
No problem.

08:31.270 --> 08:33.799
Aren't you going to ask me who the prisoner is?

08:34.030 --> 08:36.230
The person you desperately want to save

08:36.330 --> 08:38.330
must not be a bad person.

08:44.940 --> 08:46.870
Thank you, Young Master Wangquan.

08:48.030 --> 08:49.090
It's getting late.

08:49.720 --> 08:51.560
You'll have a tough battle tomorrow.

08:51.560 --> 08:52.360
Get some rest.

09:11.570 --> 09:13.170
Young Master, you're awake?

09:13.870 --> 09:17.630
You slept sitting up all night.

09:18.070 --> 09:21.400
You must have felt uneasy.

09:26.910 --> 09:28.380
You're very observant

09:29.040 --> 09:30.130
and eloquent.

09:30.440 --> 09:31.910
It's truly impressive.

09:32.340 --> 09:33.620
Actually,

09:34.130 --> 09:35.930
I didn't sleep the entire night.

09:36.440 --> 09:37.200
Why?

09:39.690 --> 09:41.450
You are good at scheming,

09:42.210 --> 09:43.330
and I admire that.

09:43.620 --> 09:44.940
I just worry that

09:44.960 --> 09:47.200
if I heal your injuries,

09:47.220 --> 09:49.600
I'll lose all control over you.

09:50.470 --> 09:54.000
So, you're afraid I'll cross the river and tear down the bridge.

09:54.240 --> 09:55.920
Well, I have a suggestion.

09:56.210 --> 09:57.870
You can feed me a poison pill,

09:57.890 --> 09:58.570
and that way…

09:58.570 --> 10:00.440
Young Master, that's a good reminder.

10:00.440 --> 10:02.150
This is a Peacock Gall Poison Pill.

10:02.150 --> 10:03.410
Please, Young Master.

10:06.750 --> 10:07.880
What a coincidence.

10:07.960 --> 10:09.890
Compared to weightless promises,

10:09.960 --> 10:11.440
I trust it more.

10:14.360 --> 10:15.660
Young Master, you're quite decisive.

10:15.660 --> 10:17.260
Instead of mutual suspicion

10:17.440 --> 10:18.440
and distrust,

10:19.150 --> 10:20.320
I trust you more.

10:28.060 --> 10:31.660
[Nangong Sword Furnace]

10:36.590 --> 10:38.520
Hongye has already broken the Mystical Bell Formation.

10:38.520 --> 10:40.780
Now it's up to us.

10:59.370 --> 11:00.360
There are four guards inside,

11:00.360 --> 11:01.440
all of whom have mediocre powers.

11:01.440 --> 11:03.510
The other one should be Nangong Chui.

11:04.600 --> 11:07.080
Nangong Ye can barely hold his own against Hongye,

11:07.080 --> 11:10.280
and Nangong Chui is just a nobody who's not worth fearing.

11:10.510 --> 11:12.910
Are you confident in controlling his mind?

11:15.120 --> 11:16.580
I underestimated our Zui.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.470
Let me make it clear first.

11:18.470 --> 11:20.470
Nangong Chui is mine.

11:21.270 --> 11:21.870
Let's go.

11:26.150 --> 11:29.350
There's less than an hour left until the auspicious time.

11:29.760 --> 11:32.950
Will this little one work or not?

11:33.960 --> 11:34.910
Young Master,

11:35.240 --> 11:37.440
the demon swords are almost completed.

11:48.530 --> 11:50.240
Miss Wangquan,

11:50.630 --> 11:52.240
it's so early in the morning.

11:52.270 --> 11:55.180
Are you trying to accompany me while I'm drinking?

12:03.830 --> 12:06.360
Next time when you want to speak so disrespectfully,

12:06.360 --> 12:10.220
think carefully about whether you can speak to just anyone like that.

12:24.030 --> 12:25.260
So disobedient.

12:34.270 --> 12:35.740
Her demonic energy has been almost completely exhausted,

12:35.740 --> 12:37.540
and now she's barely conscious.

12:53.510 --> 12:55.710
The demon swords are about to be forged.

13:05.120 --> 13:06.410
Using demon cores to forge swords,

13:06.410 --> 13:07.940
the demons' malicious energy is sinking.

13:07.940 --> 13:11.550
The Li family's Spirit-purifying Mirror is used to purify the malicious energy.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.810
It's placed at the bottom of the furnace.

13:14.430 --> 13:15.810
According to Quzhuo,

13:16.030 --> 13:17.080
this Eight-Diagram Mirror should be able to

13:17.080 --> 13:21.140
stop the Spirit-purifying Mirror from purifying the malicious energy.

13:30.150 --> 13:31.310
It's done.

13:31.530 --> 13:33.080
The sword unveiling ceremony will begin soon.

13:33.080 --> 13:34.740
The sword in Nangong Ye's hand

13:34.760 --> 13:37.620
will be an evil sword filled with malicious energy.

13:41.500 --> 13:42.260
Zui.

13:43.030 --> 13:44.480
Go and change their memories,

13:44.480 --> 13:45.910
I'll sever the spell chain.

13:45.910 --> 13:46.440
Okay.

14:13.720 --> 14:14.780
Yitan!

14:19.290 --> 14:20.230
You have the Heavenly Eye,

14:20.230 --> 14:22.740
so you must know that severing the spell chain will cause the demon fire to backfire.

14:22.740 --> 14:24.270
That's why you sent me away.

14:25.600 --> 14:27.330
Fortunately, I saved her life.

14:28.790 --> 14:29.610
I'm fine.

14:30.320 --> 14:31.980
Go and change their memories.

14:34.440 --> 14:36.200
Okay, I'll go then.

15:02.140 --> 15:04.970
Read after me from now on.

15:05.480 --> 15:06.740
Today, the swords are completed.

15:06.740 --> 15:08.670
Nan couldn't bear the pain

15:08.690 --> 15:10.360
and jumped into the furnace and died.

15:10.360 --> 15:12.600
Today, the swords are completed.

15:12.620 --> 15:15.930
Nan couldn't bear the pain

15:16.070 --> 15:18.080
and jumped into the furnace and died.

15:18.080 --> 15:18.960
Good boys.

15:25.900 --> 15:29.400
The major noble families have long been in cahoots with Nangong.

15:29.400 --> 15:32.400
Are you truly confident that you can suppress Nangong

15:32.460 --> 15:35.460
and save all the demons being used to forge the swords?

15:35.620 --> 15:36.950
Let's change the topic.

15:37.000 --> 15:38.530
This is quite a mood killer.

15:39.950 --> 15:40.590
True.

15:41.530 --> 15:42.840
Then how about we talk about

15:42.840 --> 15:45.240
the Peacock Gall Poison Pill you just took?

15:45.960 --> 15:48.150
You won't feel anything when it first enters your body,

15:48.150 --> 15:49.550
but as time passes,

15:49.790 --> 15:52.630
your blood will gradually clot in your veins.

15:53.150 --> 15:54.200
Without an antidote...

15:54.200 --> 15:55.150
My death...

15:58.980 --> 16:00.320
will be a terrible sight, right?

16:00.320 --> 16:02.050
Your corpse will be crystal blue.

16:02.050 --> 16:03.710
It's quite pretty, actually.

16:16.230 --> 16:17.120
I see.

16:18.120 --> 16:18.870
We'll...

16:20.840 --> 16:22.010
see in the future.

16:39.520 --> 16:42.730
Did the little demon really jump into the furnace and die?

16:42.930 --> 16:43.590
Yes.

16:43.750 --> 16:44.910
Today, the swords are completed.

16:44.910 --> 16:46.480
Nan couldn't bear the pain

16:46.510 --> 16:48.440
and jumped into the furnace and died.

16:48.440 --> 16:50.680
Then why does my leg hurt so much?

16:51.320 --> 16:53.320
It feels like I've been beaten.

16:55.400 --> 16:57.220
Young Master, the auspicious time is coming.

16:57.220 --> 16:59.240
Master asks if the swords are ready.

16:59.900 --> 17:01.290
Tell the Master

17:03.050 --> 17:05.180
the Heavenly Swords have been forged,

17:05.319 --> 17:06.810
and we can draw them at the auspicious time.

17:06.810 --> 17:07.430
Yes.

17:47.030 --> 17:51.270
[Auspiciousness and Blessings]

18:11.790 --> 18:13.310
The four demon swords are complete.

18:13.310 --> 18:15.110
Master, please draw the swords.

18:15.440 --> 18:16.500
Invite the swords.

18:35.110 --> 18:36.500
I am not talented,

18:36.750 --> 18:39.640
but based on the unique characteristics of each family master's martial arts,

18:39.640 --> 18:43.220
I prepared a sword that matches each one of you.

18:43.590 --> 18:45.530
The materials used to forge these swords

18:45.530 --> 18:47.990
are all demon cores over a hundred years old.

18:48.270 --> 18:50.470
Everyone, please examine your swords.

19:02.790 --> 19:03.880
Good sword.

19:04.510 --> 19:05.490
Good sword.

19:06.350 --> 19:07.440
Good sword.

19:08.270 --> 19:09.760
Master Cheng's sword

19:10.070 --> 19:13.070
was forged with the demon core of the Eagle Demon King.

19:13.200 --> 19:14.750
It carries a natural fierceness.

19:14.750 --> 19:18.410
This sword contains at least a hundred years of demonic energy.

19:18.830 --> 19:19.760
Master Nangong,

19:20.160 --> 19:22.100
I, Cheng Ling, admire you!

19:26.820 --> 19:28.170
Young Master Wangquan,

19:28.260 --> 19:30.820
do you have something to say?

19:31.070 --> 19:34.530
Since ancient times, great swords have chosen their masters,

19:35.070 --> 19:37.970
and swordsmen also choose their swords.

19:38.270 --> 19:39.950
What do you mean?

19:40.070 --> 19:42.110
What else could it mean?

19:42.240 --> 19:44.680
The conservative Wangquan Manor

19:44.750 --> 19:47.750
cannot stand the Nangong family's rise.

19:48.460 --> 19:50.350
You look down on our swords,

19:50.350 --> 19:51.920
but so what?

19:52.440 --> 19:55.240
Your Wangquan Manor only has the Wangquan Sword,

19:55.350 --> 19:59.070
but our Nangong family has many demon swords.

19:59.680 --> 20:01.610
As long as demons don't go extinct,

20:01.720 --> 20:03.920
there will always be more in the future.

20:06.920 --> 20:09.220
My son is rough with his words,

20:09.590 --> 20:11.520
but he makes a point.

20:11.880 --> 20:14.590
Master Nangong, what do you mean?

20:18.720 --> 20:20.980
With the help of Dongfang Divine Fire,

20:21.580 --> 20:24.950
I will certainly be even stronger.

20:28.420 --> 20:30.820
I also have a Celestial Demon Divine Sword.

20:31.020 --> 20:33.820
I would like to invite you all to examine the sword!

21:27.390 --> 21:28.680
[Auspiciousness and Blessings]

21:34.820 --> 21:37.620
Raise the banner and challenge the Alliance Leader.

21:37.620 --> 21:40.010
Master Nangong Ye, is this what you mean?

21:40.440 --> 21:41.240
Indeed.

21:42.110 --> 21:44.590
Then you should take your Nangong family's banner

21:44.590 --> 21:45.960
and challenge the headquarters of the Yiqi Alliance,

21:45.960 --> 21:47.420
Wangquan Manor.

22:09.200 --> 22:12.590
When raising the banner and challenging the Alliance Leader,

22:12.590 --> 22:13.920
killing is acceptable.

22:14.590 --> 22:16.900
This is a rule set by the Yiqi Alliance.

22:17.720 --> 22:20.340
Since I want to change the rules,

22:20.750 --> 22:22.750
why do I have to stick to the old ways?

22:22.830 --> 22:24.620
The headquarters of Yiqi Alliance

22:24.620 --> 22:27.080
could also be my Nangong's residence.

22:28.070 --> 22:29.280
Family masters,

22:29.510 --> 22:30.590
what do you think?

22:45.960 --> 22:47.870
Today, I, Nangong Ye,

22:48.240 --> 22:49.790
raise my sword

22:50.070 --> 22:53.800
to challenge Wangquan Hongye for the position of Alliance Leader.

22:54.160 --> 22:57.090
This battle will be perilous and life-threatening.

22:57.350 --> 22:58.680
Young Master Wangquan,

22:59.640 --> 23:01.590
do you dare to accept the challenge?

23:01.590 --> 23:02.860
If you dare not,

23:03.030 --> 23:04.830
sever the Wangquan Sword first!

23:34.310 --> 23:35.640
After leaving the seat,

23:36.110 --> 23:37.710
take five steps, turn right,

23:38.050 --> 23:39.300
and then take

23:39.720 --> 23:40.780
ten steps forward.

24:03.510 --> 24:04.840
Young Master Wangquan,

24:05.720 --> 24:07.320
do you have to be so arrogant?

24:55.510 --> 24:57.920
If you want to challenge the Wangquan Sword,

24:57.920 --> 24:58.920
it depends on

24:59.550 --> 25:01.720
whether you have the ability.

25:29.200 --> 25:31.460
The Wangquan Sword isn't that powerful.

25:31.470 --> 25:32.900
The Yiqi Alliance

25:33.550 --> 25:35.480
will belong to the Nangong family.

25:36.350 --> 25:39.110
Young Master Wangquan, swords are ruthless.

25:39.240 --> 25:40.640
You still have time to admit defeat

25:40.640 --> 25:42.510
and sever the Wangquan Sword.

26:11.190 --> 26:12.410
All swords

26:15.350 --> 26:16.230
unite as one!

26:31.720 --> 26:34.000
What is the meaning of the Wangquan Sword?

26:34.000 --> 26:36.350
When the sword is drawn, all swords obey.

26:36.600 --> 26:38.730
Want to challenge the Wangquan Sword?

26:38.810 --> 26:39.880
Nangong Ye,

26:40.330 --> 26:41.460
do you deserve it?

26:49.040 --> 26:50.170
It was you.

26:51.030 --> 26:53.830
You broke the formation and saved him!

27:04.440 --> 27:06.960
Your only opponent is me.

27:08.190 --> 27:09.640
Ten years ago,

27:10.530 --> 27:12.830
I lost to Wangquan Shouzhuo

27:13.640 --> 27:16.610
because I wasn't ruthless enough.

27:17.790 --> 27:19.210
Today,

27:19.590 --> 27:22.910
I won't lose to this little boy!

27:30.530 --> 27:31.660
Something's wrong.

27:33.510 --> 27:35.000
I am...

27:35.730 --> 27:38.170
the strongest in the world!

27:48.690 --> 27:50.090
None of you...

27:50.590 --> 27:53.020
can stop me!

28:00.240 --> 28:00.920
Father!

28:03.320 --> 28:05.590
He's gone mad! He even killed his own son!

28:06.300 --> 28:08.350
Using demon cores to forge swords can really cause backfires!

28:08.350 --> 28:09.410
Let's go! Let's go!

28:27.030 --> 28:28.060
Wangquan Hongye!

28:28.110 --> 28:28.900
Enough!

29:16.110 --> 29:18.640
Miss Xie, use the Divine Fire to set them free.

29:38.680 --> 29:40.510
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred;

29:40.510 --> 29:42.260
eternal night befalls.

29:42.550 --> 29:45.710
None of you can escape.

29:46.590 --> 29:48.240
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred;

29:48.240 --> 29:49.940
eternal night befalls.

29:50.800 --> 29:51.870
Hongye,

29:52.320 --> 29:53.850
you must remember my words.

29:54.160 --> 29:56.340
Stop the conflict between humans and demons

29:56.340 --> 29:58.940
and prevent the eternal night from befalling.

30:07.590 --> 30:11.980
[Auspiciousness and Blessings]

30:25.590 --> 30:26.680
Congratulations, Young Master,

30:26.030 --> 30:27.740
[Sword Attendant Feng]

30:26.790 --> 30:28.250
for fulfilling your wish.

30:28.510 --> 30:29.640
I'll leave

30:30.400 --> 30:31.260
the rest to you.

30:31.680 --> 30:32.310
Yes.

31:24.620 --> 31:25.740
Young Master Wangquan.

31:25.740 --> 31:26.930
Miss Huaizhu,

31:27.590 --> 31:29.780
I called you here to inform you

31:29.860 --> 31:31.390
that Nan has been rescued.

31:31.680 --> 31:34.000
Yitan and Zui have already taken Nan to Tushan.

31:34.000 --> 31:35.350
There's a demon market

31:35.350 --> 31:37.200
that shelters homeless demons.

31:37.840 --> 31:39.070
If that is the case,

31:39.410 --> 31:41.270
I, Dongfang Huaizhu, would like to thank you

31:41.270 --> 31:43.270
on behalf of Nan and the other demons

31:43.330 --> 31:44.590
who have been saved.

31:47.810 --> 31:49.290
In a single day,

31:49.320 --> 31:52.000
you wiped out the Nangong noble family without leaving a trace.

31:52.000 --> 31:54.530
You are truly a remarkable person, capable of

31:54.540 --> 31:56.200
turning the tides of fate with a single motion.

31:56.200 --> 31:57.760
Are you insinuating

31:59.160 --> 32:00.690
that I am not a good person?

32:01.200 --> 32:02.310
Someone like you,

32:02.310 --> 32:04.310
standing at the center of the storm,

32:04.680 --> 32:07.010
cannot be described simply as good or bad.

32:09.070 --> 32:10.070
I see.

32:10.780 --> 32:11.970
What you mean is that

32:13.640 --> 32:15.500
we are not the same kind of people.

32:16.830 --> 32:19.490
What do you think about the words Nangong Ye said

32:19.920 --> 32:21.110
before his death?

32:26.550 --> 32:27.350
Young Master.

32:31.970 --> 32:33.410
[Young Master, Mu Xiaowu, the person you had me investigate, was arrested]

32:31.970 --> 32:33.410
[by the Inspection Bureau days ago on charges of unlawfully releasing demon slaves and is currently detained in their prison.]

32:33.690 --> 32:35.350
The person you're looking for

32:36.710 --> 32:38.710
is indeed in the Inspection Bureau.

32:41.930 --> 32:43.850
[Yiqi Alliance]
[Inspection Bureau]

32:51.110 --> 32:53.880
The Inspection Bureau is independent from the Yiqi Alliance.

32:53.880 --> 32:56.020
Are you planning to go there alone

32:56.040 --> 32:57.480
to rescue him?

32:58.880 --> 32:59.550
Let's go.

33:40.850 --> 33:41.940
Bring someone out?

33:42.110 --> 33:43.160
Who?

33:43.920 --> 33:44.880
Mu Xiaowu.

33:45.590 --> 33:48.520
This is the release document from the Yiqi Alliance.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.570
Who is Mu Xiaowu?

33:50.750 --> 33:52.460
His real name is Mu Renzhi.

33:52.790 --> 33:55.250
[Yiqi Alliance]
[Director of Inspection Bureau]

33:52.960 --> 33:54.890
He is the fifth-born in his family,

33:55.020 --> 33:56.950
so everyone calls him Mu Xiaowu.

34:00.270 --> 34:01.820
So what if there's a document?

34:01.820 --> 34:02.590
Even with a document,

34:02.590 --> 34:05.000
you still have to follow the rules of the Inspection Bureau.

34:05.000 --> 34:06.440
Let's calculate.

34:10.150 --> 34:11.150
Is this person male or female?

34:11.150 --> 34:12.440
How long have they been here?

34:12.440 --> 34:13.230
Male.

34:13.550 --> 34:15.320
He has probably been here for less than half a month.

34:15.320 --> 34:16.270
A male

34:18.000 --> 34:19.730
means he is capable of working.

34:20.110 --> 34:21.110
Here,

34:21.110 --> 34:22.960
his starting price for release is 300 taels.

34:22.960 --> 34:24.900
His daily expenses are 2.2 taels.

34:25.510 --> 34:26.920
He has been here for 15 days.

34:26.920 --> 34:28.710
15 days is...

34:29.429 --> 34:30.560
3 multiplied by 5...

34:30.630 --> 34:33.810
Then, add an inspection fee.

34:34.230 --> 34:36.230
This, rounded off,

34:36.840 --> 34:38.719
comes to around 400 taels.

34:39.190 --> 34:41.150
After paying and completing the registration,

34:41.150 --> 34:42.360
you can bring him out in ten days.

34:42.360 --> 34:43.400
It costs money

34:43.630 --> 34:44.889
to be imprisoned here?

34:47.630 --> 34:48.550
What?

34:48.670 --> 34:51.190
Are you saying that eating, drinking, and other needs here don't cost money?

34:51.190 --> 34:53.880
Then why do we need to wait for 10 days to bring him out?

34:53.880 --> 34:54.630
Why?

34:55.110 --> 34:56.920
I have so many people imprisoned here.

34:56.920 --> 34:57.800
I need to release them one by one.

34:57.800 --> 34:58.800
Doesn't it need

34:58.800 --> 35:00.180
verification?

35:00.400 --> 35:02.030
What if I release the wrong person one day?

35:02.030 --> 35:03.710
Who's going to take responsibility

35:03.710 --> 35:05.160
for that, you or you?

35:05.880 --> 35:06.670
Cut the crap.

35:06.960 --> 35:08.290
Pay the money and leave.

35:08.510 --> 35:09.430
Miss Huaizhu,

35:10.440 --> 35:12.100
what do you think we should do?

35:13.440 --> 35:16.190
Young Master, I came in a rush

35:16.510 --> 35:18.280
and didn't bring that much money.

35:18.280 --> 35:19.320
Why don't we

35:19.400 --> 35:22.030
use your sword to offset the cost?

35:26.450 --> 35:27.440
Come on. What are you two

35:27.440 --> 35:28.630
whispering about?

35:29.880 --> 35:31.320
You think you can just use a stupid sword

35:31.320 --> 35:33.270
to offset 400 taels of silver?

35:33.510 --> 35:35.110
Do you think your sword is...

35:38.710 --> 35:39.640
The wangquan...

35:41.530 --> 35:42.660
The Wangquan Sword?

35:43.440 --> 35:46.240
Young Master, aren't you at Nangong's residence?

35:47.400 --> 35:48.910
You're well-informed.

35:49.280 --> 35:51.900
Have you also placed your bets on Nangong Ye,

35:52.070 --> 35:53.510
hoping that the Yiqi Alliance

35:53.510 --> 35:56.880
will change its leader?

35:56.900 --> 35:57.820
I dare not.

36:05.140 --> 36:06.430
Within ten counts,

36:07.400 --> 36:08.660
I want to see Mu Xiaowu.

36:10.000 --> 36:10.880
Otherwise...

36:19.940 --> 36:21.900
[Mu Xiaowu]

36:21.550 --> 36:22.360
Yan.

36:24.590 --> 36:25.330
Yan!

36:26.760 --> 36:27.550
Xiaowu?

36:29.080 --> 36:29.630
How have you been?

36:29.630 --> 36:30.150
Yan!

36:33.080 --> 36:35.010
A couple eventually got together.

36:35.280 --> 36:36.980
It can be considered a good story.

36:36.980 --> 36:38.670
It's too early to say that.

36:41.370 --> 36:43.540
Yitan's grandfather is proud

36:43.630 --> 36:45.090
and values bloodlines greatly.

36:45.090 --> 36:46.980
Someone as ordinary as Mu Xiaowu

36:47.230 --> 36:48.830
is unlikely to catch his eye.

36:49.610 --> 36:51.140
Success depends on effort.

36:51.470 --> 36:54.220
Some things are worth fighting for.

36:57.040 --> 36:58.150
No matter what,

36:58.440 --> 37:00.280
I've brought out the person you mentioned.

37:00.280 --> 37:02.510
Now, can you cure me of the poison?

37:04.240 --> 37:05.910
Young Master, please don't rush.

37:05.910 --> 37:06.460
Really?

37:07.620 --> 37:08.510
Really?

37:09.030 --> 37:09.800
Yes.

37:10.220 --> 37:11.520
That's great, Yan!

37:11.550 --> 37:12.230
Be careful!

37:12.290 --> 37:14.070
Yan, we are having a child, Yan!

37:14.230 --> 37:15.400
Are we really having a child?

37:15.400 --> 37:16.530
Be careful.

37:17.150 --> 37:18.660
Just as you said,

37:19.430 --> 37:22.840
I don't think that just because Yan is pregnant,

37:23.000 --> 37:25.150
Mu Xiaowu, coming from a poor family,

37:25.230 --> 37:26.500
would be accepted by the Yang family.

37:26.500 --> 37:28.030
That's great, Yan!

37:30.050 --> 37:31.070
Put me down.

37:32.230 --> 37:33.440
Don't tell me

37:33.760 --> 37:37.020
you want me to personally act as a matchmaker for Mu Xiaowu.

37:37.550 --> 37:39.440
Yes. I hope you can help.

37:40.960 --> 37:42.630
How far should I go?

37:42.820 --> 37:45.800
I can't be looking after them for their whole lives, can I?

37:45.800 --> 37:47.600
Within a month would be the best.

37:47.670 --> 37:49.070
Once they are married,

37:49.340 --> 37:50.690
I will cure your poison.

37:50.960 --> 37:52.030
A month? That soon?

37:52.670 --> 37:54.020
The longer we wait, the more troubles will occur.

37:54.020 --> 37:56.580
I owe you this one.

38:00.860 --> 38:02.230
This friend

38:04.200 --> 38:05.460
is so important to you?

38:06.540 --> 38:09.370
How fortunate in life it is to have a confidant.

38:10.060 --> 38:11.640
Yan is

38:11.800 --> 38:13.520
a part of my life to me.

38:15.890 --> 38:16.940
Miss Huaizhu,

38:29.260 --> 38:30.790
go back and wait for my news.

38:31.760 --> 38:33.890
Then I'll be waiting for the good news.

38:34.350 --> 38:35.750
Young Master, take care.

39:05.730 --> 39:06.610
Your Highness.

39:07.990 --> 39:09.190
As you expected,

39:09.590 --> 39:11.540
the conflict between humans and demons within the circle never ends,

39:11.540 --> 39:13.230
with hatred growing stronger.

39:13.230 --> 39:15.930
You will become more and more powerful.

39:16.320 --> 39:17.370
Not enough.

39:17.800 --> 39:18.810
It's not enough.

39:19.890 --> 39:21.030
I don't care about

39:21.500 --> 39:22.720
humans or demons.

39:23.270 --> 39:25.590
I want this world to be in ruins.

39:25.800 --> 39:27.270
Hatred and despair

39:27.640 --> 39:29.740
are the sources of my power.

39:38.940 --> 39:41.740
With love fading and hatred growing in this world,

39:42.740 --> 39:44.940
I will definitely return to the circle.

39:47.790 --> 39:48.950
Darkness

39:49.070 --> 39:51.240
will consume everything!
